，本店將保留蒐證並依法維護自身權益之權利。\n\n最後，感謝一路支持本店的每一位顧客，也謝謝所有願意理性看待事件的朋友。我們會持續專注於做好每一碗拉麵，以服務與品質回應大家的支持與信任。\n\n謝謝大家。",1]]],[1783741912,1799553112],null,null,null,"3766194822243070140","863423845067277992",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003d4665041cdc874088\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003dChill%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5\u0026ludocid\u003d17019221671062291762\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEKC9hoiD0PnY1QE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEKC9hoiD0PnY1QE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F863423845067277992%2FlocalPosts%2F3766194822243070140/version/1783741912736000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCLzh2rXJx42iNBIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFS0M5aG9pRDBQblkxUUUaE0Nnd0kyUHZHMGdZUW9JV2l0QU0\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dChill%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5\u0026ludocid\u003d17019221671062291762\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEKC9hoiD0PnY1QE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5VOYDYW0SAx8VNVomZtN4Jz","0ahUKEwjf-5qG69GWAxXuj68BHU3VCMEQ544CCCcoGw",null,"2026年7月11日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u863423845067277992/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMzNzY2MTk0ODIyMjQzMDcwMTQw","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u863423845067277992/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMzNzY2MTk0ODIyMjQzMDcwMTQw",null,null,null,null,null,["3766194822243070140","CIHM0ogKEKC9hoiD0PnY1QE","CgwI2PvG0gYQoIWitAM"]]],1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[9],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["老闆夫妻是熱愛露營的人，喜歡在戶外放慢腳步，感受大自然、星空與三五好友相聚的溫度。這份對生活的熱愛，也成為Chill拉麵的品牌靈魂。店內還設置兒童遊戲區，希望帶給你像露營時一樣自在、溫暖又療癒的感受。\n\n我們相信，一碗好拉麵不只是填飽肚子，更是一種放鬆心情的方式。不論今天過得忙碌還是疲憊，都歡迎來Chill拉麵坐坐，吃一碗熱騰騰的拉麵，享受屬於自己的Chill時光。\n\n🍜 用心烹煮、\n🔥 堅持品質、\n🏕️ 熱愛露營、\n😊 享受生活。\n\n來Chill拉麵，\n享受一碗讓人想再回來的好味道"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://sup